<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73876" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμό-τροφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reared</i> or <i>bred
				together with,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ap.</u>
				199
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Hom.</u>
				9.2
			</span></i> (in both places of Artemis and Apollo); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δίκα καὶ ὁ. Εἰρήνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					13.7
				</span></i>
			 (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμότροπος</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ. τοῖσι ἀνθρώποισι θηρία,</span> of
			domestic animals, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.66
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> abs.,
				<i>feeding together, having the same diet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				83d
			</span></i> (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμότροπος</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ. πεδία</span> plains <i>where we fed
				in common,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				329
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
